\section{Usage}{


The most important functions of the package are \code{\link[=zanicc]{zanicc()}}, which performs
Bayesian inference for several (non)parametric count compositional models, and
\code{\link[=inverse_posterior_zanimlnbart]{inverse_posterior_zanimlnbart()}} for performing pollen-based palaeoclimate
reconstruction using a modular framework built on a previously fitted
ZANIM-LN-BART model.
}

